  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">r1 gate RELEASED 2026-11-25 (joint mcp-r1/mcp-r2 determination under the owner's delegation; see notes/decisions.md D-r1-gate). Before starting, merge origin/master into this branch (merge, never rebase). Do not edit r1's ISS-010 files (DecisionCommitService, Actions/DecisionActionExecutors, RecordCreationService, CallerWriteAuthorization, CallerRecordAccessProbe, CallerMetadataReadMemo, AssignTaskNotifier, the email-bell job handler) or the Decision wizard heading files (DecisionWizard/steps/FoundStep.tsx, Worklist/IssueLine.tsx, composeIssueLine.ts) without messaging mcp-r1 first.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Tools run as the caller (IHttpContextAccessor; UserContextRequired; no app-only identity fallback); they call the same daily-briefing service the chosen REST route calls, with the same user scoping.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">spaarke_get_briefing: readOnlyHint true (or false only if it may start generation via McpLongRunning), destructiveHint false, idempotentHint true; _meta.ui.resourceUri ui://spaarke/briefing.html. Any data-only tool the widget calls is app-only (visibility ["app"]). Ledger rows in RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.Briefing.cs.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Widget: one Console component (DailyBriefingApp) behind 010's seam, transport from src/client/widgets/shared/mcp/ (021); _meta.ui.csp empty; no fetch, MSAL or Xrm; host-unsupported actions hidden; Fluent v9 semantic tokens; follows host light/dark; keyboard operable (NFR-09). Bundle &lt; 1 MB target, 3 MB hard ceiling via the widget's check-bundle-size.mjs (NFR-03).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">The Console's and the standalone page's Daily Briefing tests pass unchanged; Mcp:Enabled=false removes the tool and the resource (ADR-032).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-015">Model-visible text: TL;DR ≤ 1,000 chars and counts; channel detail only in structuredContent for the widget; nothing secured. Logs: tool name, latency, outcome, correlation id. Result &lt; 64 KiB.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source: spec.md 'Placement &amp; New Components'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule': +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, 55 MB total triggers architecture review, 60 MB is a hard stop. No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Every test this task adds lives on a KEEP path (tests/integration/{auth,contract,regression,data-mutation}/** or tests/unit/domain/**, or the widget's own jest suite), mocks only at module boundaries, and uses no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Node install: npm install --legacy-peer-deps --no-audit --no-fund (not npm ci). Before each push run bash scripts/quality/check-changed-cs-format.sh origin/master.</constraint>
  </constraints>

