  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">For a fixture user, the tool's structuredContent equals the chosen REST route's response; the text is ≤ 1,000 chars.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">resources/list includes ui://spaarke/briefing.html with an empty _meta.ui.csp; resources/read returns the embedded HTML.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Widget jest: renders a fixture briefing through a fake transport; zero fetch/Xrm calls; unsupported actions hidden.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">check-bundle-size.mjs passes (size recorded; ≤ 3 MB).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: with Mcp:Enabled=false neither the tool nor the resource is listed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Daily Briefing package tests and the Console's tests pass unchanged; ArchTests and conformance pass; publish-size delta recorded; no new HIGH CVE.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test scope: cover the stated contract plus the edge cases named in these criteria; anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in the task notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

